{
  "id": "303",
  "title": "Distinguishing Between “z” and “j”",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2017-05-13",
  "synopsis": "A company boss is not too happy about visiting the subsidiary in Guangdong.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/416/a0d55e4936d31e9fc81dad7ab710024d5717c86d.mp3?1494265413",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "z和j\n\n    有个公司的老总姓贾，大家都喜欢叫他贾总。\n    他有一个分公司在广东，但是他不喜欢去那里。为什么呢？\n    因为有些广东人说普通话不太好，分不清z和zh，也分不清z和j。所以，这个贾总每次去广东，总能听到别人叫他：“杂种好！杂种好！”",
    "traditional": "z和j\n\n    有個公司的老總姓賈，大家都喜歡叫他賈總。\n    他有一個分公司在廣東，但是他不喜歡去那裡。為什麼呢？\n    因為有些廣東人說普通話不太好，分不清z和zh，也分不清z和j。所以，這個賈總每次去廣東，總能聽到別人叫他：“雜種好！雜種好！”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“z” and “j”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "有个公司的老总姓贾，大家都喜欢叫他贾总。",
      "traditional": "有個公司的老總姓賈，大家都喜歡叫他賈總。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu ge gōng sī de lǎo zǒng xìng jiǎ dà jiā dōu xǐ huan jiào tā jiǎ zǒng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There was a company boss whose name was Jia, and everyone liked to call him chief Jia."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他有一个分公司在广东，但是他不喜欢去那里。",
      "traditional": "他有一個分公司在廣東，但是他不喜歡去那裡。",
      "pinyin": "tā yǒu yí ge fēn gōng sī zài guǎng dōng dàn shì tā bù xǐ huan qù nà lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "为什么呢？",
      "traditional": "為什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "wèi shén me ne",
      "english": "He had a subsidiary in Guangdong, but he didn't like to go there."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Why is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "因为有些广东人说普通话不太好，",
      "traditional": "因為有些廣東人說普通話不太好，",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi yǒu xiē guǎng dōng rén shuō pǔ tōng huà bú tài hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "分不清z和zh，也分不清z和j。",
      "traditional": "分不清z和zh，也分不清z和j。",
      "pinyin": "fēn bu qīng 1 hé 1 yě fēn bu qīng 1 hé 1",
      "english": "Because some people from Guangdong cannot speak mandarin very well."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "所以，这个贾总每次去广东，总能听到别人叫他：“杂种好！杂种好！”",
      "traditional": "所以，這個賈總每次去廣東，總能聽到別人叫他：“雜種好！雜種好！”",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ zhè ge jiǎ zǒng měi cì qù guǎng dōng zǒng néng tīng dào bié ren jiào tā zá zhǒng hǎo zá zhǒng hǎo",
      "english": "They don't clearly distinguish between “z” and “zh”, and “z” and “j”."
    }
  ],
