    "sentence_translations": [
      "“z” and “j”",
      "",
      "There was a company boss whose name was Jia, and everyone liked to call him chief Jia.",
      "",
      "He had a subsidiary in Guangdong, but he didn't like to go there.",
      "Why is that?",
      "",
      "Because some people from Guangdong cannot speak mandarin very well.",
      "They don't clearly distinguish between “z” and “zh”, and “z” and “j”.",
      "So each time chief Jia went to Guangdong, he would hear people calling him: “Hi, you bastard! Hi, you bastard!”"
    ]
